                "description": "Don-Jo 9454 4-7/8 inch x 1-1/4 inch Adjustable T-Strike - Adjustable Strikes allow you to adjust the latching point of your door hardware. The 4-7/8 inch x 1-1/4 inch Adjustable T-Strike is great for use on doors where the door is warped or the frame is not level. It is an easy solution to stop a door from rattling because you can get the door to sit tight against the door jam. It is made out of 13 gauge steel and is available in brass or chrome finishes. For use on residential or commercial applications.",
